cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Carveout in published work, please cite it as below."
title: Carveout
abstract: >-
  Open-vocabulary object segmentation and 3D localization for trained 3D
  Gaussian Splatting scenes. Carveout renders synthetic views of a scene,
  segments them with SAM 3 Promptable Concept Segmentation, lifts the 2D masks
  to per-Gaussian labels, and exports labelled 3D object instances.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Hugues
    family-names: Bruyère
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/smallfly/Carveout"
# The publication date of THIS version: set to the day of the public push.
date-released: 2026-09-17
# SPDX identifier: GPLv3, or any later version at the recipient's option.
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - gaussian-splatting
  - 3d-segmentation
  - open-vocabulary
  - instance-segmentation
  - sam3
  - radiance-fields

